OL,5,G1830 Home and Away
OL,6,     FEden fears a great loss.
OL,7,     FMackenzie's patience wears thin.
OL,8,     FDavid struggles to join the dots.
OL,9,G1900 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,10,     FEdwardo visits the mobile surgery
OL,11,     Fin Peterborough about his ear;
OL,12,     FMichael suffers ongoing pain in
OL,13,     Fhis side; and new mum Jazmine
OL,14,     Fworries about her postpartum
OL,15,     Fbleeding and clots.
OL,16,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,17,     FAs winter hits, the cold weather
OL,18,     Fcauses a spike in admissions at
OL,19,     FBarnsley Hospital. For the
OL,20,     Fcasualty team, there's no let-up
OL,21,     Fin the blue-light arrivals.
